    "created_at": "2017-05-11T19:07:42Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-05-11T19:07:42Z",
    "body": "Tests updated. The deltas from the new spec proposed in this patch are:\r\n\r\n- Edge, for empty string actions (but not missing), returns the document URL instead of the base URL\r\n- Gecko, for empty string actions (but not missing), returns the empty string\r\n- WebKit/Blink match this patch\r\n\r\nProposed new commit message: \r\n\r\n```\r\nRemove unnecessary form.action special reflection\r\n\r\nNo browsers implemented this as specced. Edge and Gecko have some\r\nspecial reflection rules for the empty string case, but not for the\r\nmissing attribute, and they disagree anyway. We can instead just make\r\nform.action match other reflected URL attributes, as implemented by\r\nWebKit/Blink.\r\n```",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/300887582/reactions",
      "total_count": 0,
