    "created_at": "2017-05-12T03:46:10Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-05-12T03:46:10Z",
    "body": "If I have:\r\n```html\r\n<base href=https://google.com/>\r\n.<form action=><input type=submit></form>\r\n<script>w(document.querySelector(\"form\").action)</script>\r\n```\r\nChrome and WebKit report google.com but submit to the document URL. Firefox reports the empty string but submits to the document URL. I actually think what the specification says is better given these results.",
